<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FALL AT FIX.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FALL AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor rates fell</p>
<p>slightly at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Thursday.</p>
<p>The three-month rate was flat at 3.08 percent.</p>
<p>					 May 15 fix	   May 14 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor			  3.00 pct		3.01 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor			  3.04 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor			  3.08 pct		3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor			  3.18 pct		3.18 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor			  3.28 pct		3.29 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor			 3.38 pct		3.39 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
